$ heat run --help
usage:  heat run [--nx value] [--cfl value] [--help] [--markdown] [--version]

Run a simulation

Optional switches:
   --nx value
          environment variable name "HEAT_RUN_NX"
    default value 64
    Cells along each direction
   --cfl value
          environment variable name "HEAT_RUN_CFL"
    default value 0.25
    CFL number
   --help, -h
    Print this help message
   --markdown, -md
    Save this help message in a Markdown file
   --version, -v
    Print version
